        </profile>
        <profile name="Oath of Rynn" id="5324-763c-61f5-9e4b" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Once per battle, at the start of either player’s Command phase, this model can use this ability. When it does, until the end of the turn, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of weapons equipped by models in this model’s unit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="To the Last" id="b20-ca96-c186-27dc" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While this model is leading a unit, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, add 1 to the Hit roll if that unit is below its Starting Strength, and add 1 to the Wound roll as well if that unit is Below Half-strength.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Leader" id="39c9-ff24-66c5-c3aa" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">This model can be attached to the following units:

■ Company Heroes
■ Bladeguard Veteran Squad
■ Sternguard Veteran Squad
■ Tactical Squad</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Inspiring Commander" id="1544-468d-6b7c-a26b" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">If you include this model in your army, until the end of the battle, non-Character models in Sternguard
Veteran Squad units from your army have an Objective Control characteristic of 2 while they are not Battle-shocked.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
