          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Once per game, if this unit successfully makes a charge against an enemy VEHICLE or FORTIFICATION, you may use this ability, if you do roll a die, on a 2+ that model takes D6+2 Mortal Wounds. Additionally you may destroy a model in this unit when you activate this ability to change the mortal wounds dealt to D3+5.</characteristic>
